# Certificate Branding and Generation Check

## Checklist
- [ ] Login as admin@skillpilot.com
- [ ] Navigate to /admin/settings/branding
- [ ] Change Brand Color to #FF4500 and Save
- [ ] Refresh /admin/settings/branding and verify the color #FF4500
- [ ] Logout
- [ ] Login as student@skillpilot.com
- [ ] Navigate to /courses
- [ ] Select "Mastering Laravel" or equivalent and click "Learn"
- [ ] Locate and click "Download Certificate"
- [ ] Verify PDF generation/download
- [ ] Final report
